# React Flow render

Follow `REACTFLOW_RENDER.md`. Phase 1 removed `packages/extensions/format-reactflow/`. Phase 8
restores the encoder and this document into `packages/app/src/graph/` from the `pre-reset` tag.

Non-negotiables:

- Published edges are **data** (`$ref` / `$state`, including nested paths and `.when()` gates)
  with handles, never visible control source-to-target lines.
- Visual-only `ecp-group` frames are allowed for parallel / branch / loop structure. They are
  not authored from the canvas in this pass; children use `parentId`.
- Port bindings are literals and refs; make sure output and nested input handles exist for every
  edged ref.
- Fan-out through multiple `$ref`s is supported. Don't invent multi-source fan-in on one input
  key.
